    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You got separated from your little owner and ended up on a strange farm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now transform into all kinds of objects \u2014 a swim ring, a toilet, a carpet\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to get on the news and help your owner find you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out \u2014 some humans want to catch you. Transform and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/6f2075e3e3d12a553d304e65e67c6d1b.poster.avif?t=1744359837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/6f2075e3e3d12a553d304e65e67c6d1b.webm?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/6f2075e3e3d12a553d304e65e67c6d1b.mp4?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Play as a shape-shifting cat with endless tricks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Disguise yourself as a box, trash can, swimming ring, carpet, or even\u2026 a cabbage?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf0 <strong>Become the \u201cMost Wanted Cat\u201d and see your face on billboards, newspapers, and TV!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Explore a farm and town full of secrets\u2014pranks have no limits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Befriend all kinds of quirky animals along the way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd20 <strong>Put on a stylish cowboy hat and become the coolest \u201cWild West Kitty\u201d on the farm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re a magical cat with the power to transform into all kinds of wacky things!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/8ebe4ff5df0b02bb5375fc41c29a14b6.poster.avif?t=1744359837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/8ebe4ff5df0b02bb5375fc41c29a14b6.webm?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/8ebe4ff5df0b02bb5375fc41c29a14b6.mp4?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each form gives you a special ability \u2014 explore the world and complete fun missions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/b578755b2b88abbeeaf974e71ae7f25a.poster.avif?t=1744359837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/b578755b2b88abbeeaf974e71ae7f25a.webm?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/b578755b2b88abbeeaf974e71ae7f25a.mp4?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your different forms will surely attract attention \u2014 look, you\u2019re on a billboard! Even the news!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/ffe09b488e5bbaa0fd222c3f66af90be.poster.avif?t=1744359837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/ffe09b488e5bbaa0fd222c3f66af90be.webm?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/ffe09b488e5bbaa0fd222c3f66af90be.mp4?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your awesome powers to prank those evil humans! Like knocking them down with a big thump!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/e0afb733ce5ee67ffe32d9b139b6d744.poster.avif?t=1744359837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/e0afb733ce5ee67ffe32d9b139b6d744.webm?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/e0afb733ce5ee67ffe32d9b139b6d744.mp4?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You got separated from your little owner and ended up on a strange farm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now transform into all kinds of objects \u2014 a swim ring, a toilet, a carpet\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to get on the news and help your owner find you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out \u2014 some humans want to catch you. Transform and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/6f2075e3e3d12a553d304e65e67c6d1b.poster.avif?t=1744359837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/6f2075e3e3d12a553d304e65e67c6d1b.webm?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/6f2075e3e3d12a553d304e65e67c6d1b.mp4?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Play as a shape-shifting cat with endless tricks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Disguise yourself as a box, trash can, swimming ring, carpet, or even\u2026 a cabbage?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf0 <strong>Become the \u201cMost Wanted Cat\u201d and see your face on billboards, newspapers, and TV!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Explore a farm and town full of secrets\u2014pranks have no limits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Befriend all kinds of quirky animals along the way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd20 <strong>Put on a stylish cowboy hat and become the coolest \u201cWild West Kitty\u201d on the farm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re a magical cat with the power to transform into all kinds of wacky things!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/8ebe4ff5df0b02bb5375fc41c29a14b6.poster.avif?t=1744359837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/8ebe4ff5df0b02bb5375fc41c29a14b6.webm?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/8ebe4ff5df0b02bb5375fc41c29a14b6.mp4?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each form gives you a special ability \u2014 explore the world and complete fun missions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/b578755b2b88abbeeaf974e71ae7f25a.poster.avif?t=1744359837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/b578755b2b88abbeeaf974e71ae7f25a.webm?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/b578755b2b88abbeeaf974e71ae7f25a.mp4?t=1744359837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your different forms will surely attract attention \u2014 look, you\u2019re on a billboard! Even the news!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s