    "short_description": "Play as a mischievous cat and stir up trouble on a lively farm and town! Disguise yourself as absurd objects, befriend other cats, and pull off pranks before making a quick escape. Your face might even appear on billboards, newspapers, and TV\u2014wanted as the \u201cMost Mysterious Troublemaker Cat\u201d!",
